# A schematic Giants' Foundry for replays. Not the real map: just the things the Pilot points at,
# laid out on one open floor so every walk is short.
#
# Facts:
#  - names are RuneLite's (net.runelite.api.gameval): Kovac is NpcID.GIANTS_FOUNDRY_KOVAC; the
#    machines GIANTS_FOUNDRY_TRIP_HAMMER, _GRINDSTONE, _POLISHING_WHEEL, _LAVA_POOL, _WATERFALL;
#    the bank chest GIANTS_FOUNDRY_CHEST; the crucible, mould jig and preform storage are the
#    multilocs GIANTS_FOUNDRY_CRUCIBLE_MULTI, _MOULD_JIG and _PREFORM_STORAGE
#  - the jig shows GIANTS_FOUNDRY_JIG_EMPTY, _JIG_MOULD (set), _JIG_MOULD_FILLED,
#    _JIG_MOULD_COOLING and _JIG_MOULD_COOLED, as RuneLite names them. Which varbit drives that
#    multiloc in the game is not known here: GIANTS_FOUNDRY_MOULD_STATE stands in, 0 to 4, and
#    the Pilot reads only what the jig shows
#  - the heat bar: the Pilot reads only the widths of GiantsFoundryHud.TEMPERATURE_BAR_RECT1 (the
#    whole bar) and GRIND_BAR (one band); 300 and 60 here make each band a fifth of the bar
#
#   y 5012  lavaPool                 waterfall
#   y 5006  tripHammer  grindstone  polishingWheel
#   y 5000  kovac  (player 3200)  storage
#   y 4994  chest   crucible   jig
#        x 3190                       3214

scene 3150 4950

npc GIANTS_FOUNDRY_KOVAC "Kovac" 3192 5000 as kovac

object GIANTS_FOUNDRY_CHEST 3192 4994 as chest
object GIANTS_FOUNDRY_CRUCIBLE_MULTI 3200 4994 2 2 as crucible
multiloc GIANTS_FOUNDRY_MOULD_JIG GIANTS_FOUNDRY_MOULD_STATE GIANTS_FOUNDRY_JIG_EMPTY GIANTS_FOUNDRY_JIG_MOULD GIANTS_FOUNDRY_JIG_MOULD_FILLED GIANTS_FOUNDRY_JIG_MOULD_COOLING GIANTS_FOUNDRY_JIG_MOULD_COOLED
object GIANTS_FOUNDRY_MOULD_JIG 3206 4994 2 2 as jig
object GIANTS_FOUNDRY_PREFORM_STORAGE 3208 5000 as storage
object GIANTS_FOUNDRY_TRIP_HAMMER 3192 5006 2 2 as tripHammer
object GIANTS_FOUNDRY_GRINDSTONE 3200 5006 2 2 as grindstone
object GIANTS_FOUNDRY_POLISHING_WHEEL 3208 5006 2 2 as polishingWheel
object GIANTS_FOUNDRY_LAVA_POOL 3192 5012 2 2 as lavaPool
object GIANTS_FOUNDRY_WATERFALL 3210 5012 2 2 as waterfall

# The HUD's heat bar: a band is a fifth of it.
widget GiantsFoundryHud.TEMPERATURE_BAR_RECT1 width 300
widget GiantsFoundryHud.GRIND_BAR width 60
